// Bede, the Hollow's gardener (T4.4). SQ-07 Tomatoes: the irrigation pump leaks; he needs a gasket from outside.
npc: bede
name: Bede
start: done [flag:sq_07_done]
start: fit [flag:sq_07_started, item:pump_gasket]
start: back [flag:sq_07_started]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {+clue:hollow_exists(bede), flag:sq_07_started}
  bede (gruff): "Do not step on the seedlings. Marrow let you in? Then you are either harmless or very good. Here, look. These are tomatoes. Real ones."
  bede (worried): "And they are dying. The pump behind the garden leaks at the seal and the beds go dry by noon. I need a gasket, an old rubber ring about the size of a coin. We cannot make one. The Belt's scrap yard has a drawer of them, or someone in the Stacks may have one."
  > "I will see what I can do." -> end
  > "Why a tomato?" -> why

node: why
  bede (gruff): "Because it is the one thing nobody is allowed to be sad about. Go on."
  > "I will see what I can do." -> end

node: back
  bede (worried): "Gasket? A rubber ring about the size of a coin, for the pump behind the garden. The Belt's scrap yard, or someone in the Stacks with a tin of odd rubber."
  > [!clue:june_hums] "Who is the girl humming in the commons?" -> june
  > "Not yet." -> end

node: june
  on_enter: {+clue:june_hums(bede)}
  bede (fond): "June. She hums when she is nervous, and she is nervous around anyone new. You will hear her before you see her, and so will anyone else who is listening."
  > "I see." -> back

node: fit
  bede (excited): "That is it. Hold the light."
  > "Here you are." {-item:pump_gasket, flag:sq_07_done, +item:tomato, flag:hollow_watch, +clue:june_hums(bede)} -> fitted

node: fitted
  bede (warm): "There. Listen to that: it holds. Take a tomato. Tell Marrow what you did; she will not say thank you, but she will listen differently. We have set a watcher at the old tunnel mouth because of you, which is the only honour I have to give."
  > "Thank you." -> done

node: done
  bede (warm): "The beds are green again. Do not tell anyone where the tomatoes came from."
  > [!clue:june_hums] "Who is the girl humming in the commons?" -> june2
  > [!flag:tune_known] "Do you know the end of the song you sing to the seedlings?" -> tune
  > "Goodbye." -> end

node: tune
  on_enter: {flag:tune_known}
  bede (soft): "The end? Of course I do. Nobody ever asks. It goes down, not up, and it comes home to where it started. Here. Hm, hm... there. Now you know it."
  bede (soft): "Do not sing it where the walls listen. June has been waiting for it all her life, you know. She thinks the song never ends."
  > "I will find her." -> done

node: june2
  on_enter: {+clue:june_hums(bede)}
  bede (fond): "June. She hums when she is nervous. You will hear her before you see her."
  > "I see." -> done

node: end
  bede (gruff): "Mind the seedlings."
  end
